  "label": "Creator's sarcastic self-deprecation mapped onto Jack Nicholson's smug expression",
  "description": "The text 'i love it when people think my posts are about them' and 'as if i had enough time to insult you bastards individually' is mapped onto Jack Nicholson's smug, dismissive expression. The visual material (Jack Nicholson's expression) serves as a metaphor for the creator's sarcastic, self-deprecating attitude toward online interactions where users misinterpret content as being directed at them. The mapping is based on the iconic association of Jack Nicholson's expression with sarcasm and detachment, which aligns with the tone of the text.",
